OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FOutbreaks of
OL,6,Frain will move across Northern Ireland
OL,7,Fand into Scotland overnight, perhaps
OL,8,Fturning heavy later. Patchy rain also
OL,9,Fpossible across northern England.
OL,10,FMostly dry elsewhere with clear
OL,11,Fspells. A warm night in the south,
OL,12,Fcooler for some further north.
OL,13,
OL,14,CMonday:FRain affecting much of
OL,15,FScotland on Monday, some heavy.
OL,16,FScattered showers across Northern
OL,17,FIreland and other western areas,
OL,18,Fthough most of England and Wales fine
OL,19,Fwith some hot sunshine. Humid.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
